# What deploy/Containerfile is sent from the repository (#1381): Go/, Web/, the runtimes'
# toolsets and the deploy files the image carries (#2140), so a checkout's builds, worktrees
# and node_modules never go to the builder.
*
!Go/
!Web/
!App/Resources/toolsets/
!deploy/compose.public.yaml
!deploy/compose.hosted.yaml
!deploy/Caddyfile.public
!deploy/Caddyfile.hosted
!deploy/make-secrets.sh
Go/out/
Web/node_modules/
Web/dist/
